            <link>https://github.com/LakshyaSingh/now-updates/releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>48</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.10.30</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.30

- Fixed long song titles disappearing between marquee cycles; scrolling now repeats continuously after its initial pause.
- Fixed short titles being unnecessarily truncated by giving the title column its correct layout width.
- Made browser playback controls target the exact YouTube Music or Spotify Web tab shown in the overlay.
- Prevented LinkedIn, YouTube, and other Chrome media tabs from intercepting play, pause, next, or previous commands.
]]></description>
