            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.29

- Added a smooth, continuous marquee for song titles that are too long to fit in the overlay.
- Short titles remain still, while long titles pause briefly before beginning to scroll.
- Marquee motion respects the macOS Reduce Motion accessibility setting.
]]></description>
